sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant DocumentsController
  participant UserRepo
  participant DocumentRepo
  participant MaintenanceRepo

  User->>DocumentsController: GET /api/condominiums/{id}/documents
  DocumentsController->>DocumentsController: HasCondominiumAccess(routeCondominiumId)
  DocumentsController->>UserRepo: GetById(authenticatedUserId)

  alt role is Admin
    DocumentsController->>DocumentRepo: GetAll and filter by condominiumId
    DocumentsController-->>User: Return all condominium documents
  else role is Resident
    DocumentsController->>MaintenanceRepo: Get maintenance IDs for user unit
    DocumentsController->>DocumentRepo: GetAll and filter by context rules
    Note over DocumentsController: Context filters: Condominium, Assembly,\nFinancial in same condominium; Unit only own unit;\nMaintenance only own unit requests.
    DocumentsController-->>User: Return allowed subset
  end
